# The Protomaps archive (public/data/*.pmtiles) is deliberately NOT ignored.
#
# It is a fetched input rather than a build product — 36.8 MB of OpenStreetMap
# extracted from the Protomaps daily planet build — so ignoring it looked right.
# It is also a required deploy artifact, and this repo deploys straight from a
# git push, so ignoring it meant shipping a map with no basemap. Committing it
# is the smaller cost: 36.8 MB is well inside GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit,
# and it changes about as often as the OSM extract is refreshed.
#
# Rebuild or refresh it with `fetch_inputs.sh protomaps` in the monorepo's
# Backend/pipeline; it is not regenerable from this repository alone.

